ypeText":"∀ {n : Nat} (i : Nat) (x : BitVec n),\n  Eq.{1} (BitVec.toNat (BitVec.setWidth i x)) (HMod.hMod.{0, 0, 0} (BitVec.toNat x) (HPow.hPow.{0, 0, 0} 2 i))","unsafe":false,"value":346,"source":{"code":"@[simp, bitvec_to_nat, grind =]\ntheorem toNat_setWidth (i : Nat) (x : BitVec n) :\n    (setWidth i x).toNat = x.toNat % 2^i := by\n  let ⟨x, lt_n⟩ := x\n  simp only [setWidth]\n  if n_le_i : n ≤ i then\n    have x_lt_two_i : x < 2 ^ i := lt_two_pow_of_le lt_n n_le_i\n    simp [n_le_i, Nat.mod_eq_of_lt, x_lt_two_i]\n  else\n    simp [n_le_i, toNat_ofNat]","start":97,"end":106},"axioms":["propext"]}